cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these measurements, please cite the paper."
title: "Same probe, different depths: how the gap between output and internals scales in biological foundation models"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code and released result cards for a study of how the
  elicitation gap -- the difference between a biological foundation model's
  sanctioned output and a linear probe of its best internal layer, read at
  identical capacity -- scales with model size across five tasks, two
  modalities and four model families.
